i2c-display (0.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add a native SH1106 driver so 1.3" 128x64 SH1106 modules work instead of
    falling back to the mock display: page-addressed writes, the 2-column
    GDDRAM offset, and the SH1106 DC-DC enable sequence; rotation 0/2 and
    brightness (screensaver dim and blank) are supported
  * SSD1306 and SH1106 now share their frame buffer and drawing primitives
    (internal/display/mono.go) and I2C drivers share bus open and address
    resolution
  * Add a tested Radxa Rock 5C platform profile (SH1106 on /dev/i2c-8,
    40-pin header pins 3/5)
  * Document SH1106 support and the per-board I2C bus numbers

 -- Dennis Gilmore <dennis@ausil.us>  Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:22:30 -0600

